Gershwin Terminal
=================

url    = https://github.com/gershwin-desktop/gershwin-terminal.git
tag    = 26.09
commit = 2c77b9c3f7c8a4b7a200830f5ba81b5f9085be06
date   = 2026-09-17

This revision is built by tools/desktop/build-terminal.sh, which
foxyn-desktop(8) runs on the desktop image (tools/linux/build.sh desktop):
it downloads the revision's archive (identical to the submodule), checks
its SHA-256 and applies tools/desktop/patches/terminal-dragonfly.txt
(FreeBSD's termios.h and libutil.h instead of Linux's termio.h and pty.h,
and -liconv for DPorts' libiconv, as on FreeBSD and OpenBSD).  It is
installed as /System/Applications/Terminal.app, which the Dock lists.  It
is not part of buildworld.  Keep build output outside the submodule; when
upgrading, update the revision and checksum in build-terminal.sh too.
License: GPL text in Resources/COPYING and file-specific notices; see docs/desktop-terminal.md. Complete provenance review and preserve applicable notices
and source obligations before distributing selected components.
On upgrade, review dependencies, ABI, installation paths and desktop tests.
